    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"5250\" data-end=\"5284\">Level 18 — <strong data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5284\">Eye of the Storm</strong></h2><p data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5313\">You become the still point.</p><h3 data-start=\"5315\" data-end=\"5337\">Once per Soma Break</h3><p data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5370\">For 1 minute, in a 4 squares radius:</p><ul data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5501\"><li data-start=\"5371\" data-end=\"5413\"><p data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5413\">Burn does not increase for you or allies</p></li><li data-start=\"5414\" data-end=\"5462\"><p data-start=\"5416\" data-end=\"5462\">Fear, charm, and morale effects are suppressed</p></li><li data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5501\"><p data-start=\"5465\" data-end=\"5501\">Ongoing emotional effects are paused</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5525\">After the effect ends:</p><ul data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5547\"><li data-start=\"5526\" data-end=\"5547\"><p data-start=\"5528\" data-end=\"5547\">You gain <strong data-start=\"5537\" data-end=\"5547\">1 Burn</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5549\" data-end=\"5601\">Violence happens around you.<br data-start=\"5577\" data-end=\"5580\" />It does not take you.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
